From 66df3e5b46865fb6a9ae077ec23c6eebb2833898 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:49:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): skip redundant Tormach tool changes

Track the last tool loaded by this program while retaining compensation,
the machine-Z lift and first-traverse clearance for repeated tools.
Pin first, repeated, different and returning tool changes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1626
